{"conflicts_with": null, "content": {"text": "John: Hey Maria, hope you're doing OK. I had to share something cool with you - I asked family and friends to join the virtual support group I am a part of and be advocates for the military. It's been awesome seeing so many people coming together to back the courageous people serving our nation."}, "creation_event": "v3-ingest-3.3-V3-HYBRID-FULL-R6-MIXEDN-locomo-conv-41/session_27-5e5c3301c1194378d2ea7423", "creation_timestamp": "2026-09-15T10:34:12.359737+00:00", "equivalent_to": null, "lifecycle_state": "CREATED", "memory_id": "5e5c3301c1194378d2ea7423", "memory_type": "foundation", "parent_ids": [], "source": {"reference_id": "5e5c3301c1194378d2ea7423", "source_type": "phase2_umr"}, "superseded_by": null}
{"conflicts_with": null, "content": {"text": "Maria: Wow, John! Way to go helping veterans! I'm doing my part too, volunteering at a homeless shelter. It's so rewarding."}, "creation_event": "v3-ingest-3.3-V3-HYBRID-FULL-R6-MIXEDN-locomo-conv-41/session_27-2e623883bd33c91a175a7080", "creation_timestamp": "2026-09-15T10:34:12.388763+00:00", "equivalent_to": null, "lifecycle_state": "CREATED", "memory_id": "2e623883bd33c91a175a7080", "memory_type": "foundation", "parent_ids": [], "source": {"reference_id": "2e623883bd33c91a175a7080", "source_type": "phase2_umr"}, "superseded_by": null}
{"conflicts_with": null, "content": {"text": "John: Maria, that's great! That picture shows a lot of joy. What got you started at that place?"}, "creation_event": "v3-ingest-3.3-V3-HYBRID-FULL-R6-MIXEDN-locomo-conv-41/session_27-11ba8bf8c7c80db302015eb6", "creation_timestamp": "2026-09-15T10:34:12.404924+00:00", "equivalent_to": null, "lifecycle_state": "CREATED", "memory_id": "11ba8bf8c7c80db302015eb6", "memory_type": "foundation", "parent_ids": [], "source": {"reference_id": "11ba8bf8c7c80db302015eb6", "source_type": "phase2_umr"}, "superseded_by": null}
{"conflicts_with": null, "content": {"text": "Maria: I started volunteering here about a year ago after witnessing a family struggling on the streets. It made me want to help, so I reached out to the shelter and asked if they needed any volunteers. They said yes, and it has been a really fulfilling experience for me since then."}, "creation_event": "v3-ingest-3.3-V3-HYBRID-FULL-R6-MIXEDN-locomo-conv-41/session_27-95876cce715672173d667fc3", "creation_timestamp": "2026-09-15T10:34:12.424137+00:00", "equivalent_to": null, "lifecycle_state": "CREATED", "memory_id": "95876cce715672173d667fc3", "memory_type": "foundation", "parent_ids": [], "source": {"reference_id": "95876cce715672173d667fc3", "source_type": "phase2_umr"}, "superseded_by": null}
{"conflicts_with": null, "content": {"text": "John: Wow, Maria! You really made an impact \u2013 it's awesome! I seriously admire what you do."}, "creation_event": "v3-ingest-3.3-V3-HYBRID-FULL-R6-MIXEDN-locomo-conv-41/session_27-5fc0fdfc68bfd965ed41f2c2", "creation_timestamp": "2026-09-15T10:34:12.441526+00:00", "equivalent_to": null, "lifecycle_state": "CREATED", "memory_id": "5fc0fdfc68bfd965ed41f2c2", "memory_type": "foundation", "parent_ids": [], "source": {"reference_id": "5fc0fdfc68bfd965ed41f2c2", "source_type": "phase2_umr"}, "superseded_by": null}
{"conflicts_with": null, "content": {"text": "Maria: Thanks John. That really means a lot. It's been tough but knowing I can make a difference keeps me motivated."}, "creation_event": "v3-ingest-3.3-V3-HYBRID-FULL-R6-MIXEDN-locomo-conv-41/session_27-be94190bbeb8c3f974a6a621", "creation_timestamp": "2026-09-15T10:34:12.460727+00:00", "equivalent_to": null, "lifecycle_state": "CREATED", "memory_id": "be94190bbeb8c3f974a6a621", "memory_type": "foundation", "parent_ids": [], "source": {"reference_id": "be94190bbeb8c3f974a6a621", "source_type": "phase2_umr"}, "superseded_by": null}
{"conflicts_with": null, "content": {"text": "John: Maria, what's the deal with that note? Who wrote it and what does it say?"}, "creation_event": "v3-ingest-3.3-V3-HYBRID-FULL-R6-MIXEDN-locomo-conv-41/session_27-c3163e3ce90e377902e1bca4", "creation_timestamp": "2026-09-15T10:34:12.480374+00:00", "equivalent_to": null, "lifecycle_state": "CREATED", "memory_id": "c3163e3ce90e377902e1bca4", "memory_type": "foundation", "parent_ids": [], "source": {"reference_id": "c3163e3ce90e377902e1bca4", "source_type": "phase2_umr"}, "superseded_by": null}
{"conflicts_with": null, "content": {"text": "Maria: One of the residents at the shelter, Cindy, wrote it. It's a heartfelt expression of gratitude and shows the impact of the support they receive."}, "creation_event": "v3-ingest-3.3-V3-HYBRID-FULL-R6-MIXEDN-locomo-conv-41/session_27-9572dfe624b13f87971f5c07", "creation_timestamp": "2026-09-15T10:34:12.496632+00:00", "equivalent_to": null, "lifecycle_state": "CREATED", "memory_id": "9572dfe624b13f87971f5c07", "memory_type": "foundation", "parent_ids": [], "source": {"reference_id": "9572dfe624b13f87971f5c07", "source_type": "phase2_umr"}, "superseded_by": null}
{"conflicts_with": null, "content": {"text": "John: Wow, Maria, that's so cool that you're making a difference like that! You're so inspiring. Last week, we had a meaningful experience at a military memorial. It really made an impact on my kids."}, "creation_event": "v3-ingest-3.3-V3-HYBRID-FULL-R6-MIXEDN-locomo-conv-41/session_27-be7956813bc149b0fab46a1a", "creation_timestamp": "2026-09-15T10:34:12.515630+00:00", "equivalent_to": null, "lifecycle_state": "CREATED", "memory_id": "be7956813bc149b0fab46a1a", "memory_type": "foundation", "parent_ids": [], "source": {"reference_id": "be7956813bc149b0fab46a1a", "source_type": "phase2_umr"}, "superseded_by": null}
{"conflicts_with": null, "content": {"text": "Maria: That's so moving! How did they react when they saw it?"}, "creation_event": "v3-ingest-3.3-V3-HYBRID-FULL-R6-MIXEDN-locomo-conv-41/session_27-e6b0b575d84eeda00a73493e", "creation_timestamp": "2026-09-15T10:34:12.534270+00:00", "equivalent_to": null, "lifecycle_state": "CREATED", "memory_id": "e6b0b575d84eeda00a73493e", "memory_type": "foundation", "parent_ids": [], "source": {"reference_id": "e6b0b575d84eeda00a73493e", "source_type": "phase2_umr"}, "superseded_by": null}
{"conflicts_with": null, "content": {"text": "John: They were awestruck and humbled."}, "creation_event": "v3-ingest-3.3-V3-HYBRID-FULL-R6-MIXEDN-locomo-conv-41/session_27-f57de6c8fb6d6cdf0362fa26", "creation_timestamp": "2026-09-15T10:34:12.552449+00:00", "equivalent_to": null, "lifecycle_state": "CREATED", "memory_id": "f57de6c8fb6d6cdf0362fa26", "memory_type": "foundation", "parent_ids": [], "source": {"reference_id": "f57de6c8fb6d6cdf0362fa26", "source_type": "phase2_umr"}, "superseded_by": null}
{"conflicts_with": null, "content": {"text": "Maria: Imagining visiting a military memorial makes me feel humble too. It's important for younger generations to remember and appreciate those who served."}, "creation_event": "v3-ingest-3.3-V3-HYBRID-FULL-R6-MIXEDN-locomo-conv-41/session_27-32ec9c0c7dd1d87a03d51c5b", "creation_timestamp": "2026-09-15T10:34:12.570216+00:00", "equivalent_to": null, "lifecycle_state": "CREATED", "memory_id": "32ec9c0c7dd1d87a03d51c5b", "memory_type": "foundation", "parent_ids": [], "source": {"reference_id": "32ec9c0c7dd1d87a03d51c5b", "source_type": "phase2_umr"}, "superseded_by": null}
{"conflicts_with": null, "content": {"text": "John: Yeah, totally! Showing them how to respect and appreciate those who served our country is important. It was a moving experience for all of us."}, "creation_event": "v3-ingest-3.3-V3-HYBRID-FULL-R6-MIXEDN-locomo-conv-41/session_27-4f1ec11ab2eaf1b1b60779cf", "creation_timestamp": "2026-09-15T10:34:12.590239+00:00", "equivalent_to": null, "lifecycle_state": "CREATED", "memory_id": "4f1ec11ab2eaf1b1b60779cf", "memory_type": "foundation", "parent_ids": [], "source": {"reference_id": "4f1ec11ab2eaf1b1b60779cf", "source_type": "phase2_umr"}, "superseded_by": null}
{"conflicts_with": null, "content": {"text": "Maria: Yeah John, it's super important to teach kids about veterans and what they did for us. You're doing a great thing - we need more people like you!"}, "creation_event": "v3-ingest-3.3-V3-HYBRID-FULL-R6-MIXEDN-locomo-conv-41/session_27-229358bf56707ea1e3ce19b8", "creation_timestamp": "2026-09-15T10:34:12.614355+00:00", "equivalent_to": null, "lifecycle_state": "CREATED", "memory_id": "229358bf56707ea1e3ce19b8", "memory_type": "foundation", "parent_ids": [], "source": {"reference_id": "229358bf56707ea1e3ce19b8", "source_type": "phase2_umr"}, "superseded_by": null}
{"conflicts_with": null, "content": {"text": "John: Thanks, Maria. Appreciate your support. It's amazing what teamwork can accomplish!"}, "creation_event": "v3-ingest-3.3-V3-HYBRID-FULL-R6-MIXEDN-locomo-conv-41/session_27-3a8eec2653f883901c199711", "creation_timestamp": "2026-09-15T10:34:12.634914+00:00", "equivalent_to": null, "lifecycle_state": "CREATED", "memory_id": "3a8eec2653f883901c199711", "memory_type": "foundation", "parent_ids": [], "source": {"reference_id": "3a8eec2653f883901c199711", "source_type": "phase2_umr"}, "superseded_by": null}
{"conflicts_with": null, "content": {"text": "Maria: Yeah, we can really get amazing stuff done together. We can do this!"}, "creation_event": "v3-ingest-3.3-V3-HYBRID-FULL-R6-MIXEDN-locomo-conv-41/session_27-9d9f0b3601314cd1d67dea05", "creation_timestamp": "2026-09-15T10:34:12.655053+00:00", "equivalent_to": null, "lifecycle_state": "CREATED", "memory_id": "9d9f0b3601314cd1d67dea05", "memory_type": "foundation", "parent_ids": [], "source": {"reference_id": "9d9f0b3601314cd1d67dea05", "source_type": "phase2_umr"}, "superseded_by": null}
